47c9e566b4670a262718842edaeb2a","file":"preprints/An-explicit-exact-Hausdorff-gauge-for-SLE-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":66,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"da906e0882bd613bd04fccb6bf6176b2b9e770c4a77929a1b90851f86efd9302","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/An-explicit-exact-Hausdorff-gauge-for-SLE-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:2ade6eca78a667cf9760e32010d48fcb0e47c9e566b4670a262718842edaeb2a","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/An-explicit-exact-Hausdorff-gauge-for-SLE-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L66"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nLet $\\gamma$ be ordinary chordal $\\mathrm{SLE}_\\kappa$ from $0$ to\n$\\infty$ in $\\mathbb H$, parametrized by half-plane capacity $2t$,\nand set $\\Gamma=\\gamma([0,\\infty))$. For each fixed $0<\\kappa<8$,\non one event of probability one,\n\\[\n 0<\\mathcal H^h(\\gamma([s,t]))<\\infty\n \\qquad\\text{for every real }0<s<t<\\infty.\n\\]\nFor every deterministic $0<R<\\infty$,\n\\[\n \\mathbb E\\mathcal H^h(\\Gamma\\cap\\overline B(0,R))\n       \\le C_{\\kappa,R}<\\infty.\n\\]\nIn particular, on the same probability-one event,\n\\[\n \\mathcal H^h\\bigl(\\Gamma\\cap([-m,m]+i[0,m])\\bigr)<\\infty\n \\qquad(m=1,2,\\ldots).\n\\]"}
